      <marc:subfield code="a">Xiao Yu&apos;s eyes can see mysterious phenomena that normal people cannot. She deliberately pretends to be unaware of it and tries her best to avoid it - until she re-encounters the boy she tried to help back then. The boy&apos;s pained look and crumbling figure make it impossible for Xiao Yu to turn a blind eye any longer. This time, she would endeavour to save the boy from the abyss and complete the unfinished regrets of that year. The black silhouette, the uncontrollable energy, the overwhelming despair ...... hidden in the depths of the boy&apos;s heart in the box, in fact, what secrets are contained? Will Xiao Yu be able to unlock the boy&apos;s heart as she wishes?</marc:subfield>
